---BODY---
  <header class="masthead">
    <div class="kicker">Lost Science of Prophetic Engineering · Chart&nbsp;VI·c · Plate&nbsp;29</div>
    <h1>Chronotecture
      <span class="sub">622&nbsp;AD [4516&nbsp;AM] — the Islamic Hijrah Calendar, mirrored</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="prov">A rebuild of Jason&nbsp;M.&nbsp;Breshears’ hand-drawn chart&nbsp;VI·c (Breshears&nbsp;’07), with every date, span and annotation preserved verbatim; only the visual language is new. Its structural key: <b>622&nbsp;AD [4516&nbsp;AM], Mohammed’s flight from Medina, Hijrah Year One</b>. Four spans, <b>1085, 1111, 1218 and 1228 years</b>, reach an event before it and its counterpart after it; a 552-year bar reaches back to 70&nbsp;AD, and six bars run forward, the last to 2066&nbsp;AD, short of 2106&nbsp;AD [6000&nbsp;AM].</p>
  </header>

  <div class="toolbar" id="filters"><span class="lbl">Filter</span></div>
