      <div class="card"><h2>Cycle mathematics</h2><div class="hint">The arithmetic actually written on the plate, checked (AM&nbsp;=&nbsp;3895&nbsp;−&nbsp;BC or AD&nbsp;+&nbsp;3894; BC to AD spans have no year zero). Every figure on this plate holds.</div><div class="mathgrid">
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">622 AD = 4516 AM</span><span class="cap">Hijrah Year One.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">464 BC [3431 AM] ← 1085 → 1707 AD</span><span class="cap">Sparta earthquake ⇄ volcanic\quakes at Santorini.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">490 BC [3405 AM] ← 1111 → 1733 AD</span><span class="cap">Battle of Marathon [West] ⇄ Georgia 13th colony in the West.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">597 BC [3298 AM] ← 1218 → 1840 AD</span><span class="cap">Babylonians sack Jerusalem ⇄ Sir Rawlinson translates Assyrian.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">607 BC [3288 AM] ← 1228 → 1850 AD</span><span class="cap">Assyria falls to Babylonia ⇄ discovery of Assyrian library.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">622 − 552 = 70 AD</span><span class="cap">Romans destroy Jerusalem and Temple.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">622 + 140 = 762</span><span class="cap">Abbasid Dynasty makes Baghdad in Babylon its capital.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">144 × 3 = 432 · 622 + 432 = 1054</span><span class="cap">Supernova in Taurus and division of Roman Church.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">40 × 11 = 440 · 622 + 440 = 1062</span><span class="cap">Muslim Turks destroy Greek Christendom.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">622 + 1400 = 2022</span><span class="cap">Muslims defeat American forces.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">1000 + 414 = 1414 · 622 + 1414 = 2036</span><span class="cap">Antichrist defeats Muslims.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">622 + 1444 = 2066</span><span class="cap">Appearance of Enoch and Elijah.</span></div>
      </div><div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6">Each BC year is 622&nbsp;AD less the span, counted without a year zero: 622 − 1085 lands on 464&nbsp;BC, not 463. Chart&nbsp;VI·d doubles spans from the same 622&nbsp;AD.</div></div>
